+Fogchess Grove UI — reusable SVG assets
+
+Original vector artwork created for this project; no external icon pack or fonts.
+48 x 48 viewBox, 2.2-unit rounded strokes; 96px default import for crisp UI scaling.
+Use 40px on mode cards and 26px in navigation. Preserve aspect ratio and colors.
+Files are standalone, transparent outside the tile; usable in Godot, web and design tools.
+manifest.json defines semantic names, colors and legacy aliases.
+Godot: app._icon(parent, "watch", 40). Existing play/people/target aliases remain supported.
+Keep gameplay action icons and chess piece artwork separate.
